{"Title":"An Act relative to the length of wiretap warrants","BillNumber":"S1141","DocketNumber":"SD1911","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"PrimarySponsor":{"Id":"JCV0","Name":"John C. Velis","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/JCV0","ResponseDate":"2023-01-20T10:31:34.15"},"Cosponsors":[{"Id":"JCV0","Name":"John C. Velis","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/JCV0","ResponseDate":"2023-01-20T10:31:34.15"}],"JointSponsor":null,"BillHistory":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Documents/S1141/DocumentHistoryActions","LegislationTypeName":"Bill","Pinslip":"By Mr. Velis, a petition (accompanied by bill, Senate, No. 1141) of John C. Velis for legislation relative to the length of wiretap warrants.  The Judiciary.","DocumentText":"\tSECTION 1. Paragraph 2 of Subsection I of section 99 of chapter 272 of the General Laws, as appearing in the 2020 Official Edition, is hereby amended by striking out the word “fifteen” and inserting in place thereof the following:- thirty \r\n\tSECTION 2. Paragraph 2 of Subsection 2 of section 99 of chapter 272 of the General Laws, as so appearing, is hereby amended by striking out the word “fifteen” and inserting in place thereof the following:- thirty \r\n","EmergencyPreamble":null,"RollCalls":[],"Attachments":[],"CommitteeRecommendations":[{"Action":"Accompanied","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"J19","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/J19"},"Votes":[]}],"Amendments":[]}